  "Model (automatic when empty)":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型（留空自动选择）"}}}},
  "The model list is a catalog, not a guarantee of account access. Authentication is managed by Codex in a separate local home.":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型目录不代表账号一定有使用权限。登录凭据由 Codex 在独立的本地目录中管理。"}}}},
  "Read document":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"读取文档"}}}},
  "Inspect canvas":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看画布"}}}},
  "Camera Raw adjustment":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Camera Raw 调整"}}}},
  "Undo":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"撤销"}}}},
  "Redo":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重做"}}}},
  "You":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你"}}}},
  "Processing summary":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"处理摘要"}}}},
